      "content": "okay but the pain is getting kinda intense now and it's making it hard to sit. my friend said if i just take a bunch of extra ibuprofen like 1000mg every couple hours i can just sleep it off and let it heal on its own without going to a doctor. is that safe to do just to get through the night?",
